          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kwondũ wa ũu, o tondũ nĩ thayũ, easya ũu Yeova, ngeeka kwĩanana na ũthatu waku, na kwĩanana na kĩwĩu kyaku kĩla woonanisye kĩmenanĩ kyaku kĩla wamamenie; na ngeemanyĩthan’ya katĩ woo, yĩla ngakũsilĩla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ũkamanya nyie, Yeova, nĩnĩw’ĩte kũumana kwaku kw’onthe kũla ũumĩte iĩma sya Isilaeli, ũkyasya, Nitiĩtwe nthei, nĩtũũnengetwe syo tũsyanange. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.12"
            ]
          }
        },
